{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act51side", "eventName": "人們，我們", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "PA-4", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "一牆之隔", "storyInfo": "聽證會上，娜塔莉婭的“懺悔信”詳述了她的見聞：她與巴普洛維奇協商後，見到了索尼婭並得知了封鎖區裡的情況。索尼婭希望娜塔莉婭她們能想辦法切斷暴徒們的武裝補給。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g13_nobleroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness01_intro", "key": "$darkness01_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我必須重申一次，孩子。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你只是來還書，仍不願考慮我先前的建議，那麼你可以把書放在那邊的壁爐上，然後離開。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道只要我不同意您的辦法，您就真的連一句別的話也不願和我說了嗎？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放在其他時候，即使你因年輕人可愛的輕率做出再多糊塗的選擇，我都能繼續與你促膝長談，直到深夜。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "畢竟，我的確錯過了許多。關於你，關於你父母，關於你們在切城的經歷……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在我同樣能將這些都告訴您。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但現在我卻沒有資格去聽。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "面對關乎生死的問題，我無法說服你接受我的安排——離開聖駿堡避避風頭，或者至少提交一份對自己有利無害的證詞。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我無法保護你，也就無顏面對你的父母，那我又有什麼資格從你這裡瞭解有關他們的任何事情？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#16$1"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是這樣的，夫人——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#16$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這本書，你讀了嗎？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我讀了，我全都讀了，我已經明白您為什麼要把這本書借給我。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這本書的扉頁上寫著什麼？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“世上沒有任何主義，值得人們用美好的生活去交換。”", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#2$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，是的。雅科夫·彼得洛夫的《懺悔錄》，在他死後由其家人整理出版，一本背叛者用死亡換來的經驗之談。所以，我真的不明白……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你知道已經有人為這些經驗付出過生命的代價，而自己還能有所選擇，那又為何……一定要重蹈覆轍呢？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道一定要在你行將就木，甚至是像他一樣在牢獄中嚥下鮮血的時候，你才能意識到自己所堅信的只是注定被歷史遺忘的瞬間？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夫人，我……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "告訴我吧，孩子，告訴我為什麼。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……老實說，我也問過我自己。但如果……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請原諒我的厚顏無恥，我還想提一個要求。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我能按照您的辦法出具這份證詞，保全自己，您能答應我，對自治團裡的其他成員也一視同仁嗎？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然！只要你能按那些人想要的，在證詞裡列出特定人員的名字——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好。那麼，我會做的。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會向聽證會提交一份這樣的證詞……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一封“懺悔信”。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.3, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伯爵夫人？", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……啊，我在聽。你想說什麼？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，我想提醒您，仲裁人剛才提到娜塔莉婭小姐了，等一下需要請您將她的證詞遞上去。", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "下一位證人，娜塔莉婭·羅斯托娃小姐。出於特殊原因，她本人今日不會出席。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是，她已提前申請，由現場某位人士代為誦讀證詞。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仲裁人閣下——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭小姐在昨日將信件交付於我，請仲裁委員會諸位大人過目，並允許我誦讀。", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當書記官接過苦艾手中的信件時，竊竊私議的聲音越來越大，沃倫佐娃夫人感到無數目光匯集於自身，她搖了搖頭。"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼，請卓婭女士代為講述娜塔莉婭小姐在此事中的見聞。", "name": "仲裁人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2168_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“公正的仲裁委員會，以及受人敬仰的諸位大人，這是一封懺悔信……”", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“出於我的悔意，與這封信所涉及的敏感之事，除了不得不談論的巴普洛維奇外，我不會提及任何大人的明確姓名。”", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_177"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（低聲）夫人，這跟我們說的——", "name": "急切的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_177"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……先聽她唸完吧。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“……我希望，這足以換取諸位的信任。”", "name": "苦艾"}, "figure_art": "avg_405_absin_1#1$2"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper1"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“在舞會事件發生後不久，出於對索尼婭安危的深切憂慮，我託一位有影響力的人士幫忙，成功聯絡到了當天大多數被捕學生的家長。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“我得知，所有擅闖薩列夫格勒區的‘罪犯’，都將被統一關押在卡托加區，也就是現在人們口中的‘封鎖區’。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“令我意外的是，儘管家長中不乏地位顯赫的貴族，他們也難以獲得封鎖區內的確切消息。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“其中一部分人，是考慮到自身的身分敏感，不便直接涉足封鎖區。於是，他們委託我作為所有人的代表，前往探視被捕學生。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "<i>“他們向我推薦了封鎖區的管理者——樞密官巴普洛維奇。為拜訪他，隔日我便登上了隔絕卡托加區與外界的城牆。”</i>", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 720.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_ltroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro", "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……哈哈，我還見了一位您父親的朋友，舒瓦洛夫男爵，當初他舉債跑到切爾諾伯格想大撈一筆，後來又一窮二白地回到聖駿堡。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$e_atk_saw_n_1", "volume": 0.1}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但前天我們見面時，他被銬著雙手，正由兩位警官押著出城，要移送到東邊。我很好奇地問他，到底闖了什麼大禍，竟然還要被流放？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他神秘兮兮地靠近我耳邊說，參加宴會的時候，他喊了一句“礦工萬歲”。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我驚訝地問他為什麼，您猜他說什麼？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，我猜不出來。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他笑著回頭，看向那兩個押送他的警官，說：“被流放了，債主就找不到我了，哈哈哈哈。”", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這真是，特別的見聞……如果我沒有要事在身，或許聽一天都不會疲憊。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看我真是的，一閒聊就停不下來，讓您見笑了。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來，親愛的羅斯托娃小姐。我們先說正事。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "樞密官閣下，我是為——", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$e_atk_saw_n_2", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尖厲的電鑽聲徹底攪擾了巴普洛維奇的興致，他略帶歉意地向早露揮手，起身走到門邊。"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼搞的？今天負責的是誰？給我出來！", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#8$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對不起大人，昨晚帶回來的人比較多……", "name": "“十六勇士”打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我管你有多少人？不知道我正在招待客人嗎？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#8$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我現在就讓他們停下來。", "name": "“十六勇士”打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好意思，我們剛才說到哪裡了？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……原諒我的好奇，樞密官閣下。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聖駿堡各區的軍警都有統一的裝備，而剛剛與您交談的那個人拿著武器，卻身著便服。這裡有什麼特殊之處嗎？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "特殊？哈哈，羅斯托娃小姐說笑了，除非您覺得垃圾場也很特殊。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在聖駿堡工業轉型升級後，老的工業區閒置久了，就有議員提出，可以把這些地方都改造一下，再利用起來。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "比如用來關些罪犯和一些不願搬遷的窮人，在封鎖區內就地從事生產勞動，一舉多得。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本來運轉得好好的，如果不是這幾個月資源吃緊，這些工廠也不會全都停工。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，烏薩斯從來不會在無用之處多費心思。正規的軍警數量有限，給我的資金也只夠僱這種白痴幫我管理。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萬幸的是，這些傢伙至今為止還沒有出過什麼問題。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那剛才的鑽頭聲，似乎也不是在裝潢——", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，如果嚇到您的話，很抱歉。那是牙醫在做手術，我也不願他驚擾到我寶貴的客人。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "牙醫？在這裡？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，他們要鑽開蟲蛀之處，把爛掉的東西挖出來，填上新的材料……無論是牙齒，還是思想。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "相信羅斯托娃小姐的好奇心已經得到滿足了，我們該來談正事了吧？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……實在抱歉。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "剛見面時，您看過我給的名單，我是受他們父母的委託而來，希望您能讓我確認這些人的情況。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尤其考慮到那名單之中不乏達官顯貴的繼承人，還請樞密官閣下通融。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，當然。這次被捕的確實好像都是學生，可憐天下父母心，我當然知道那些大人物對自己的繼承人有多麼關切。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這些孩子要是能夠體諒半點他們父母的心思，又怎麼會做出這種大逆不道、令父母傷心的事呢？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但您也該體諒，我對於卡托加區的未來有多麼關切。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "樞密官閣下，在與您進一步談判前我得再次申明，委託我來的家長們希望能夠確認孩子們的狀態。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，當然，等一下有的是時間讓您慢慢確認他們的安危。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是那份名單上有兩個名字，我還想和羅斯托娃小姐討論一下。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您請說。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "首先是瑙姆。據我所知，他已經在昨日被釋放了，或許在您來的路上，他就已經到家了。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感謝您的告知，我會儘快和他的家長確認。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，其次就是這位——索尼婭。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "短短幾天她便在這裡名聲大噪，我也從手下那裡瞭解到了不少有關她的事蹟。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索尼婭怎麼了？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看著巴普洛維奇慣常掛在臉上的微笑，娜塔莉婭突然感覺到一絲異樣。"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別緊張，我只是好奇，她既非貴族，也不是富有人家的孩子，只是個普通學生，究竟為何能夠出現在這份名單上呢？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我無意隱瞞。只因為索尼婭是我的朋友，並非什麼真正窮兇惡極的暴徒，所以我才加上了她的名字，懇請您能讓我確認她的情況。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，天啊。羅斯托夫家的繼承人向我求助，我怎麼會拒絕呢？", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，您必須答應我兩件事：其一，請您告訴索尼婭，讓她放心留在封鎖區裡，我保證過幾天就放她出去。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其二，請依次告訴名單上學生們的家長，讓他們向議會施壓，撤回提案，保留封鎖區，無論用什麼手段。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“保留”封鎖區？您是指，卡托加區的區劃很快就會被撤銷？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，小姐，我們親愛的沃倫佐娃夫人竟然沒有告訴您嗎？這裡面對的不是什麼簡單的撤銷……而是赤裸裸的放棄。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帝國資源枯竭已經不是什麼秘密了。為了節流，帝國甚至已經窘迫到要放棄一塊位於首都的工業地塊。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早在一週前，議會就有了放棄封鎖區並拋在荒野上的提案。這個提案得到了議長的許可，也就代表著陛下的默許。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幸運的是，在一些支持我的舊貴族的力保下，這件事的推行得以拖延至今。但這不是長久之計。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我注意到您的名單中有不少知名的產業貴族，倘若他們能鼓動各自親友一同反對，想必陛下和議會也得重新考量。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這關乎他們孩子的性命，他們絕不敢怠慢。一旦收到保留封鎖區的敕令，我就放所有人離開。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……您認為我能做到？", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至少我對您抱有期待。憑您拿到了這份名單，毫無畏懼地來到這個人人避之不及的地方，還想救您的朋友。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，包括索尼婭在內，所有人的性命都在您手上了，娜塔莉婭·羅斯托娃小姐。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會轉達的，但首先，我要見到索尼婭。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“小松針”，過來。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帶這位小姐去見索尼婭吧，記得要報上娜塔莉婭的名號。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g4_blockst", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_snowstormlp", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這裡離那個傢伙——離索尼婭的駐地不遠，你先等著，我去通報。", "name": "被僱傭的打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在這裡已經有駐地了？還需要“通報”？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是她的朋友，那肯定知道，她確實是個不好對付的傢伙。", "name": "被僱傭的打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.5, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露的嘴角不禁有了一絲笑意。陰冷的街道深處吹來一陣風，她扶住帽子，側過頭去。"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "忽然，一道灰影從廢墟裡竄出。那是隻瘦骨嶙峋的雲獸，渾身都是斑塊，牠停在路中間，警惕地看向早露，嘴裡死死叼着一截東西。"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露的瞳孔驟然收縮——那是一根人的手指，蒼白、僵硬，指甲縫裡嵌著黑泥與血汙，斷口處像是被嚼碎的樹枝。"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_stickbeat"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "*烏薩斯粗口*！該死的畜生！", "name": "被僱傭的打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_smallanimal_scream"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭小姐，你沒事吧？", "name": "被僱傭的打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……沒事，牠剛才……不，沒什麼。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "街道上實在有點冷，得麻煩您儘快請索尼婭出來了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#4$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "馬上。", "name": "被僱傭的打手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2166_1#1$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看著打手逐漸消失的背影，一陣寒顫從頭傳到腳，早露原本挺直的身軀猛地軟了下來。"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$bodyfalldown1", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 3.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "yTo": 20.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她跌跌撞撞，最後倚在冰冷的磚牆上，摀住了嘴巴。將那股哽咽強行嚥下之後，淚水卻不受控制地湧出眼眶。"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.0, "to": 0.61, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_school", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一根指頭，一個屈辱的靈魂的尖叫，一片關於切爾諾伯格的、渾噩的記憶，全都瘋狂湧進少女的腦海。"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這不是她第一次經歷，她能夠獨自面對——"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，不能這樣，娜塔莉婭。這是不體面的，是不被允許的，是能被克服的。"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g4_blockst", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露蹲在地上，大口地呼吸著金屬味道的冷空氣，試圖先讓手臂停止顫抖……"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female", "loop": "true", "channel": "1", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 0.5}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female", "loop": "true", "channel": "2", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.9, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.2}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "type": "bg", "from": 0.61, "to": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "2", "fadetime": 0.8}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "zl", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "zl", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "zl", "fadetime": 0.5}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭？", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_heartbeat", "volume": 0.7, "channel": "HB", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "HB", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_tinnitus_loop", "loop": "true", "channel": "em", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "em", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female", "loop": "true", "channel": "3", "volume": 0.7, "delay": 0.2}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "3", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（艱難地呼吸）", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral", "loop": "true", "channel": "a"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "a", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "凜冬", "content": "你過度換氣了——"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "凜冬", "content": "該死！娜塔莉婭，你能聽到我說話嗎？"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rapidbreath_female", "loop": "true", "channel": "4", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "fadetime": 0.0, "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.4}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "4", "fadetime": 0.5}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "em", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#16$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我、我——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#16$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "告訴我，你現在在哪裡？", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#16$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在……我在……封鎖區……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對，你在封鎖區——*烏薩斯粗口*你們一個兩個的，到底進來做什麼？找死嗎？", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……該死，現在不該說這個。聽我說，娜塔莉婭。我在你身邊，你不是一個人。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔莉婭！", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5, "type": "bg", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索尼婭……？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#5$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對，是我。你還好嗎？", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索尼婭……不，我沒事，很高興看到你……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你也沒事。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼還是語無倫次的。這是幾？", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬伸出三個手指，戳到早露面前。"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#1$1"}, {"id": 375, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哼，至少腦子沒問題。", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1"}, {"id": 377, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我沒事，只是吹了風，咳嗽起來，心臟就有點難受。現在已經好很多了，謝謝你。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#1$1"}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了，在我面前就別裝了。是不是剛才來找我的那個傢伙惹你了？", "name": "凜冬"}, "figure_art": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1"}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的不是……唉，算了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1"}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽著，索尼婭，我能在這裡停留的時間有限，必須儘快把目前的情況都告訴你。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1"}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她四下觀察，朝凜冬示意，希望她靠得更近一點。"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我知道了，你是從帶頭的人那邊過來的。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先告訴你一聲，烈夏目前也在這裡，你還需要知道什麼嗎？", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "羅莎琳……她一直堅持要來找你，只在辦事處留下一封信就走了。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要責怪她，她也只是急著來幫我……我，我想問問大家都怎麼樣了？", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "古米還好嗎？真理她有沒有生我的氣？還有卓婭和教官她們……", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大家很好，但每個人都在擔心你。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我過來也是想確認你的安全，以及這片封鎖區……", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道你看到了什麼，但這裡發生的事，大概比你在這麼短時間內看到的還要糟糕不少。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有食物，沒有燃料，甚至沒有乾淨的飲用水。不同的人在拉幫結派，四處爭鬥、搶奪地盤和資源。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "每天都有人死。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巴普洛維奇說他會放所有人離開，只是有幾個條件——", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不會真的相信這種人說的話吧？", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我當然不會……", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，你也沒有別的辦法，否則不會還要到處求人才能進來，還只能告訴我消息，看看我怎麼樣。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼說呢，雖然剛才我說的好像很恐怖，彷彿明天大家就都玩完了，但這對我們來說並不陌生……", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一片哪怕明天就爆炸也沒人在意的封鎖區域，一群為生存相互傾碾得幾乎只剩下本能的學生……", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡的一切都有種熟悉的感覺，是不是？", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……告訴我，你現在需要什麼？我還能離開這裡，出去之後，我們這些在外面的人都會想辦法——", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我需要知道，這圈和堡壘一樣的城牆上面有多少人？除了那些混混。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "很少，巴普洛維奇請了幾名保鏢，加上穿舊款軍隊制服的那些也不超過十人。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……很好。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "50,0", "duration": 0.8, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 430, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬往早露的方向靠得更近，迫切地壓低了聲音。"}}, {"id": 432, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 433, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）如果可能的話，儘量想辦法切斷他們的武裝補給。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 435, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）武裝？但我看到他們的“保全人員”都不是專業的。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 437, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）不，你不知道。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）最近這裡每天都有彈藥補給和重型武器運進來，要是每個高地都有那樣的大傢伙守著，我們根本沒有對抗的可能。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 439, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 440, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的意思是……", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 441, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 442, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是字面上的意思。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 443, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_197_poca_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 444, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我知道了，出去之後我會和大家商量，一起想想辦法。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 445, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索尼婭，你和羅莎琳都要保重，一定要保護好自己。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 446, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 447, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別擔心，我會出去的，會帶著大家一起出去。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 448, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就像以前一樣。", "name": "凜冬"}}, {"id": 449, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 450, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 451, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 452, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 453, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 454, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 455, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 456, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 457, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 458, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}